      "created_at": "2012-12-27T19:49:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You could go to my SotM site (www.spiffworld.com/sotm) and read the Rules &amp; Clarifications PDF. &nbsp;It's a collection of all the official rulings that have been laid down by the game's creators here or on Boardgame Geek. &nbsp;It'll give you a deeper look into card interactions and maybe head off any misunderstandings about how some cards work.</p><p>There's also a bunch of accessories you can print and put together, like hp trackers and card boxes and such. &nbsp;That should keep you busy until your package arrives. :)</p>",
